    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a soft blanket\"... that's almost what it feels like. like a surrender that would finally be okay. i look at the edge of the cliff and the mist looks so welcoming, like it's calling me home. do you think there's something wrong with wanting that? wanting to just step into the quiet and never have to be tired again?",
